user default off
user zone on >zone-dev-password ~dir:* ~events ~kicks ~bus:idem:* &zone:*:requests &api:*:replies +@all -@admin -@dangerous
user api on >api-dev-password ~dir:* ~events &zone:*:requests &api:*:replies +@connection +@pubsub +@stream +@read
user login on >login-dev-password ~kicks +@connection +xadd
